{"lines":[{"x":0.67453840801391762,"t":"Sample Writing answers","y":0.03604778221391336,"w":0.2331956227620442,"h":0.019153980259620118,"c":1},{"x":0.065406126457063368,"y":0.077291585116782691,"h":0.027662805168592208,"w":0.36292879740397133,"c":1,"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 2"},{"c":1,"x":0.06760098950298267,"y":0.11452283792727436,"w":0.6960777791341145,"h":0.023661574149159925,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score."},{"t":"In our rather futuristic society for a number of reasons people are getting more interested in the","y":0.14109912218705156,"x":0.065474298845503348,"w":0.81755060831705728,"h":0.028759530632459396,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.78853688557942725,"t":"past of their hometowns. With the help of rapidly ameliorating technology their desire to learn","x":0.065613136913324197,"h":0.027376347913618426,"y":0.16262732401068103},{"h":0.026196858346532514,"x":0.06353235729623341,"y":0.18375807637871455,"c":1,"t":"about the history can be easily put into life. But what are the roots of such an eagerness?","w":0.75557739257812495},{"y":0.21212758535777332,"c":1,"w":0.76386769612630201,"t":"First of all, the hectic lifestyle that we all experience nowadays does not leave any space for","x":0.065570724011506723,"h":0.025481375704384468},{"t":"calmness and peace in our souls, so most of the people - especially adolescence - are struggling","x":0.063518902206864708,"y":0.23214534344242743,"w":0.81542572021484372,"h":0.027031633401787714,"c":1},{"x":0.063558159102150194,"h":0.026497298331648267,"c":1,"w":0.82355265299479175,"y":0.25325902669144573,"t":"with finding their feet, whilst having a broad spectrum of knowledge about the world around really"},{"w":0.80716471354166675,"h":0.027471218850503187,"t":"gives a feeling of confidence in the impermanence of life. In addition to this, it is said that being","x":0.063530184253062977,"y":0.27348795139463433,"c":1},{"x":0.0635314175274172,"y":0.29446032790494914,"h":0.026913677705331152,"c":1,"t":"aware of the past you can change the future. Consequently, if people want to live a better life in","w":0.80296152750651029},{"t":"more comfortable environment, they have to explore the history of their homes in order not to","x":0.063502559721182475,"w":0.79478179931640625,"h":0.027749853504841382,"c":1,"y":0.31451643375155269},{"h":0.016017476296396715,"y":0.33863368662021287,"w":0.17901234944661459,"t":"repeat past mistakes.","c":1,"x":0.061728393079619082},{"c":1,"t":"For this aims we are lucky to have multiple tools to carry out research into the subject. Despite","w":0.79884638468424474,"h":0.02468600233817142,"x":0.063514517808405432,"y":0.36436142728448107},{"w":0.84209930419921886,"c":1,"t":"libraries being considered as an old-fashioned and not necessarily convinient approach of learning,","x":0.059423649266294946,"y":0.38396583658182726,"h":0.026069340071211977},{"y":0.4048053600264292,"x":0.061440514751639058,"t":"there are actually quite a few books and magazines which are not available online but which are","c":1,"h":0.026161789192046925,"w":0.80711140950520832},{"x":0.061442166497973572,"y":0.42524446574631847,"w":0.80503946940104165,"h":0.027633532197231081,"c":1,"t":"extremely helpful when it comes to the local interests. News, photos, articles and interviews with"},{"t":"different people published in old magazines indeed provide with a clear image of past events.","w":0.78451288859049473,"c":1,"y":0.44540899153991398,"x":0.061442807947133055,"h":0.026838662065521768},{"c":1,"t":"Brousing the internet forums is also a great idea to find new information and make friend with","w":0.79876241048177088,"h":0.024045183745654897,"x":0.061488614986506034,"y":0.46741392408849791},{"y":0.48837209328281428,"t":"mutual objectives.","w":0.15637859344482424,"x":0.059670785479233976,"c":1,"h":0.017517188131739081},{"h":0.025369367835378465,"c":1,"y":0.51626219154078445,"w":0.82144220987955729,"t":"Putting everything into a nutshell, learning about the history of your place not only builds a sense","x":0.059415140915162777},{"x":0.059366129408301875,"y":0.53613985010632736,"h":0.026207417284782486,"c":1,"w":0.60966959635416673,"t":"of confidence but also might have a big impact on our future way of lite."},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.91133720911936489,"t":"131","x":0.85596707862843324,"c":1}],"h":3396,"w":2400}